From 1a7cc7deb97d955f14ccf45f1f50bc75e2e51ad5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Van Horn <mvanhorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 23:30:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve bumblebee against the pinned axon and nx
 versions

The umbrella pins axon ~> 0.8 and nx ~> 0.13 as overrides, but bumblebee was
requested at ~> 0.7 without one. Resolution settled on bumblebee 0.6.3, which
requires axon ~> 0.7.0 and nx ~> 0.9/0.10, so the lock contradicted the pins.

Request bumblebee ~> 0.7.1 with override: true, which depends on axon ~> 0.8.0
and nx ~> 0.12/0.13 and therefore agrees with the existing pins, and add the
same entry to the non-AI branch so both paths resolve identically.
---
 mix.exs  | 3 ++-
 mix.lock | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mix.exs b/mix.exs
index 388f3c6c99..f97d5f7db3 100644
--- a/mix.exs
+++ b/mix.exs
@@ -95,7 +95,7 @@ defmodule Bonfire.Umbrella.MixProject do
   maybe_ai_deps =
     if(with_ai?,
       do: [
-        {:bumblebee, "~> 0.7"},
+        {:bumblebee, "~> 0.7.1", override: true},
         {:axon, "~> 0.8", override: true},
         {:table_rex, "~> 4.1", override: true},
         {:nx, "~> 0.13"},
@@ -105,6 +105,7 @@ defmodule Bonfire.Umbrella.MixProject do
         # {:nx, github: "elixir-nx/nx", sparse: "nx", override: true}
       ],
       else: [
+        {:bumblebee, "~> 0.7.1", override: true},
         {:axon, "~> 0.8", override: true},
         {:nx, "~> 0.13", override: true},
         {:table_rex, "~> 4.1", override: true}
diff --git a/mix.lock b/mix.lock
index 4327cd78da..ef3615a2d1 100644
--- a/mix.lock
+++ b/mix.lock
@@ -88,7 +88,7 @@
